jected from moving rides even if  they are tall enough it is important to  note that the height minimum requirement  is dangerously low because it is only  measured by operators those who barely  meet the height limit are at higher risk  of being harmed on the ride but that's  not the only risk sometimes the problem  is that the ride could be too stressful  physically and emotionally so there is a  minimum age requirement instead but once  again you don't want to put your child  at risk when the limit is already too  low waiting an hour in line for nothing  is better than spending days at the  hospital because you fell from the ride  don't stalk the Disney Princesses they  might have the chance to be the most  beautiful women in the world but don't  think that their job is easy being too  pretty comes with a lot of disadvantages  including teenagers giving them their  phone numbers many men getting down on  one knee or fathers flirting with the  princesses while their wife is right  next to them don't forget that these  young women are only there to do their  job and they are not really interested  in you at all and Snow White is probably  the unluckiest of them all because she  is the one who met the weirdest stalker  she's had on reddit that for several  weeks a very old man would come to the  park to see her and tried to kiss her he  quickly realized that she was the only  girl with brown eyes which meant that  she was the true Snow White but when she  had a day off on Saturday and that the  man saw another woman in the costume he  was really upset so the next time  the real snow-white showed up he told  her that he would get rid of all the  snow whites with blue eyes so they could  stay together forever as you can imagine  the young woman freaked out called  security and his annual pass was revoked  and this is why Disney princesses don't  like it when you stalk them don't forget  to smile when you are in the most  magical place in the world the most  important 